{"schema_version": "exam-local-analysis-candidate-0.1", "candidate_id": "GK-NCA-2023-Q007-LOCAL-ANALYSIS", "exam_id": "GK-NCA-2023", "question_id": 7, "source_role": "answer_scoring_candidate", "candidate_status": "candidate_mixed_analysis", "candidate_kind": "analysis_excerpt_without_explicit_answer_marker", "candidate_extraction_method": "raw_answer_field_unbounded", "candidate_text": "", "candidate_text_sha256": null, "analysis_excerpt": "7. 下列对文本相关内容和艺术特色的分析鉴赏，不正确的一项是（）\nA.作者在写南国的风物时，用了“那一块一块的稻田”“那一堆一堆的房屋”等，语言的节奏感符合火\n车行进时的动态感。B.作者认为车过潭江的部分是“新宁铁路中的一段最美丽的工程”，既在于这里风景的优美，更在于工程体现了机械的诗意。\nC. 作者认为如果只把“月夜”“花朝” “青山”一类的东西当作写诗的材料，其实是不懂诗，依据是\n这些材料本身缺乏生命力。D.“诗应该给人以创造的喜悦，诗应该散布生命”是作者对诗的认识，也是他认为机械具有诗意的一个重1\n要前提。", "analysis_excerpt_sha256": "164325be8f6c054dd969f8233cd06cd2785ca69e651daca86c11329a126f5b30", "source_authority_status": "unverified_local_provided", "answer_source_status": "missing_separate_answer_bundle", "scoring_status": "not_available_as_official", "mapping_level": "M0", "kp_id": "N/A", "source_analysis_segment": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-NCA-2023/segments/analysis/Q007.md", "source_analysis_pdf": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/2023年高考语文试卷（全国甲卷）（解析卷）.pdf", "source_analysis_mineru_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/mineru_result/2023年高考语文试卷（全国甲卷）（解析卷）/full.md", "source_clean_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-NCA-2023/clean_md/analysis.md", "source_segment_clean_sha256": "164325be8f6c054dd969f8233cd06cd2785ca69e651daca86c11329a126f5b30", "source_segment_file_sha256": "f947d556179e63026f486c104a0ea22707396ed032cee850467d3b9679527994", "source_answer_bundle": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-NCA-2023/answers/answer_bundle.md", "source_answer_index": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-NCA-2023/answers/answer_index.jsonl", "review_status": "needs_manual_review", "notes": ["解析卷仅作为本地候选，不是独立答案或评分材料。", "原始解析段、题卷和 PDF 保持双链；不修改 source/prompt_text_raw。", "no_explicit_answer_marker", "manual_boundary_required", "candidate_unverified"]}
{"schema_version": "exam-local-analysis-candidate-0.1", "candidate_id": "GK-NCA-2023-Q008-LOCAL-ANALYSIS", "exam_id": "GK-NCA-2023", "question_id": 8, "source_role": "answer_scoring_candidate", "candidate_status": "candidate_mixed_analysis", "candidate_kind": "analysis_excerpt_without_explicit_answer_marker", "candidate_extraction_method": "raw_answer_field_unbounded", "candidate_text": "", "candidate_text_sha256": null, "analysis_excerpt": "8. 本文在写“机械的诗”时写到工人，请简要分析二者之间的内在联系。", "analysis_excerpt_sha256": "b0d0c68230681f43a3fd89e0233b82ed44838915d62f8c6acde612714a30a818", "source_authority_status": "unverified_local_provided", "answer_source_status": "missing_separate_answer_bundle", "scoring_status": "not_available_as_official", "mapping_level": "M0", "kp_id": "N/A", "source_analysis_segment": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-NCA-2023/segments/analysis/Q008.md", "source_analysis_pdf": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/2023年高考语文试卷（全国甲卷）（解析卷）.pdf", "source_analysis_mineru_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/mineru_result/2023年高考语文试卷（全国甲卷）（解析卷）/full.md", "source_clean_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-NCA-2023/clean_md/analysis.md", "source_segment_clean_sha256": "b0d0c68230681f43a3fd89e0233b82ed44838915d62f8c6acde612714a30a818", "source_segment_file_sha256": "afda1bf1d9783c6acdc352667640189f0eb1483bde31c3fff20daa48ccda80d6", "source_answer_bundle": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-NCA-2023/answers/answer_bundle.md", "source_answer_index": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-NCA-2023/answers/answer_index.jsonl", "review_status": "needs_manual_review", "notes": ["解析卷仅作为本地候选，不是独立答案或评分材料。", "原始解析段、题卷和 PDF 保持双链；不修改 source/prompt_text_raw。", "no_explicit_answer_marker", "manual_boundary_required", "candidate_unverified"]}
{"schema_version": "exam-local-analysis-candidate-0.1", "candidate_id": "GK-NCA-2023-Q009-LOCAL-ANALYSIS", "exam_id": "GK-NCA-2023", "question_id": 9, "source_role": "answer_scoring_candidate", "candidate_status": "candidate_unverified", "candidate_kind": "answer_excerpt_from_local_analysis", "candidate_extraction_method": "local_analysis_answer_marker", "candidate_text": "7.C8.（1）工人是机械的操控者、管理者、指挥者，是机器背后的灵魂。（2）机器的创造，本质上还是人的创造，在人的控制下，机械的力量才是完美的。（3）对机械力量的赞美，实则是对人能力的肯定。\n\n9.（1）这是联想，由轮船上的机器联想到上海的建筑所用的机器，二者都体现机器的力量，具有相似性。\n\n（2）拓展文章的广度，丰富其内容。（3）由“我”一个人的喜悦，拓展到“许多人”的喜悦，表明对机器力量的欣赏是普遍存在的，深化了文章的主题。\n\n本题考查学生分析鉴赏文章内容和艺术特色的能力。\nC.“依据是这些材料本身缺乏生命力”错误，由文中“诗应该给人以创造的喜悦，诗应该散布生命”可知，作者认为诗应该给人创造的喜悦、散布生命，并非这些材料本身缺乏生命力。\n故选C。", "candidate_text_sha256": "42f9fe6beae8906ac807ea798cd6de33ef0e30ecd0ef9c09ff39a86f6f5c155c", "analysis_excerpt": null, "analysis_excerpt_sha256": null, "source_authority_status": "unverified_local_provided", "answer_source_status": "missing_separate_answer_bundle", "scoring_status": "not_available_as_official", "mapping_level": "M0", "kp_id": "N/A", "source_analysis_segment": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-NCA-2023/segments/analysis/Q009.md", "source_analysis_pdf": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/2023年高考语文试卷（全国甲卷）（解析卷）.pdf", "source_analysis_mineru_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/mineru_result/2023年高考语文试卷（全国甲卷）（解析卷）/full.md", "source_clean_md": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-NCA-2023/clean_md/analysis.md", "source_segment_clean_sha256": "3a6bf6610a36aeee98120455f250e83ead6667ad52c6d26e124cc5181f8c6f7f", "source_segment_file_sha256": "7d3212a839fb062bad89f65cc186702c3089f4c88802f1773a27b82aa3ae2031", "source_answer_bundle": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-NCA-2023/answers/answer_bundle.md", "source_answer_index": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-NCA-2023/answers/answer_index.jsonl", "review_status": "needs_manual_review", "notes": ["解析卷仅作为本地候选，不是独立答案或评分材料。", "原始解析段、题卷和 PDF 保持双链；不修改 source/prompt_text_raw。", "exact_excerpt_fro